NAME
       id - print user and group ids

SYNOPSIS
       id [-u | -g | -G] [-n] [-r] [user]

DESCRIPTION
       Print user and group ids. Names come from /etc/passwd
       and /etc/group when they exist; otherwise numbers only.

NOTES
       UC.OS has no /etc/passwd or /etc/group by default, so
       names are missing and only numbers are printed.

SEE ALSO
       sh(1)

